to back you up.

305
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:09,790
-Hello.
-No need to make such a big deal, huh?

306
00:21:09,790 --> 00:21:10,520
Let's begin.

307
00:21:12,030 --> 00:21:13,400
We'll give you a demonstration.

308
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:15,350
The first one is the pick-and-roll.

309
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:17,480
The pick-and-roll includes a screen.

310
00:21:17,590 --> 00:21:18,200
Come on.

311
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:23,810
