is the between-the-legs pull-up jumper.

312
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:27,830
The third one.

313
00:21:27,830 --> 00:21:29,830
Chen Yu, demonstrate the Euro step.

314
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:30,440
Okay.

315
00:21:34,510 --> 00:21:35,960
So this is the Euro step?

316
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:38,440
Yes. The next one is a bit similar, too.

317
00:21:38,460 --> 00:21:39,990
But it's not quite the same.

318
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:41,340
I know this one.

319
00:21:41,350 --> 00:21:42,310
Crossover.

320
00:21:43,310 --> 00:21:43,920
Awesome.

321
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,160
Footwork positions.

322
00:22:10,540 --> 00:22:13,690
[The Starry Sky's
Basketball Fundamentals Review]

323
00:22:45,340 --> 00:22:47,060
[Gu Han]

324
00:22:49,630 --> 00:22:52,580
[In a couple of days, I'll participate in
the Starry Sky's streamer audition.]

325
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,310
In a couple of days,

326
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:04,000
I'll participate in
the Starry Sky's streamer audition.

327
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:05,460
