328
00:23:13,790 --> 00:23:15,510
Okay. I'll be there a bit late.

329
00:23:54,590 --> 00:23:56,920
Zhou Xiangxiang,
you haven't registered yet, right?

330
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,250
Come and register here.

331
00:24:19,830 --> 00:24:21,560
How is your preparation going?

332
00:24:22,510 --> 00:24:23,480
Not bad.

333
00:24:25,510 --> 00:24:26,790
There's only one spot.

334
00:24:27,350 --> 00:24:28,750
The hosts in our station

335
00:24:28,750 --> 00:24:30,550
