Broadcasting and Hosting.

336
00:24:30,550 --> 00:24:33,510
The program team will definitely
prefer people with formal training.

337
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:34,960
You don't need to be too nervous.

338
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:37,000
Just treat it as a practice.

339
00:24:38,550 --> 00:24:40,410
I think you're absolutely right.

340
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:41,590
We are all the same.

341
00:24:41,750 --> 00:24:43,870
So you don't
need to be too nervous, either.

342
00:24:43,870 --> 00:24:44,460
You...

343
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:48,270
Don't you know my family is...

344
00:24:48,270 --> 00:24:50,680
