345
00:24:50,790 --> 00:24:52,670
Then you must not lose later.

346
00:24:53,070 --> 00:24:53,680
Good luck.

347
00:24:55,510 --> 00:24:56,790
There are five minutes left.

348
00:24:56,790 --> 00:24:58,450
