353
00:25:22,030 --> 00:25:24,540
All contestants,
please get ready to come on stage.

354
00:25:24,540 --> 00:25:26,970
[The Starry Sky]

355
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:26,490
Good luck, Xiangxiang.

356
00:25:28,380 --> 00:25:30,750
[The Starry Sky]

357
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,960
Hello, Miss.

358
00:25:30,310 --> 00:25:32,840
How many championships
