372
00:25:51,030 --> 00:25:51,680
One.

373
00:25:52,350 --> 00:25:54,160
What is Curry's Chinese nickname?

374
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:55,070
Elementary School Student.

375
00:25:55,070 --> 00:25:56,350
Which team has won the most

376
00:25:56,350 --> 00:25:57,640
CBA championships?

377
00:25:58,960 --> 00:25:59,890
Pick-and-roll.

378
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:01,960
Euro step.

379
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:03,160
Bulls Dynasty.

380
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:06,400
Germany.

381
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:09,550
Oriental Sharks.

382
00:26:12,790 --> 00:26:14,480
Now, for the second round's
broadcasting session,

383
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:16,310
