to the stage.

384
00:26:14,540 --> 00:26:15,990
[The Starry Sky]

385
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,270
You may begin.

386
00:26:20,590 --> 00:26:22,350
Hello, basketball fans.

387
00:26:22,350 --> 00:26:23,550
I'm Zhou Xiangxiang.

388
00:26:23,830 --> 00:26:26,440
The theme
of today's interactive session is

389
00:26:26,590 --> 00:26:28,400
Share Your All-Star Dream.

390
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:29,510
With the changes in the format

391
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:31,310
of the NBA All-Star Game,

392
00:26:31,830 --> 00:26:33,960
the number of votes
for the NBA All-Star Game

393
00:26:33,960 --> 00:26:35,550
have been constantly updating

394
00:26:35,550 --> 00:26:36,640
and setting a new record, too.

395
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:38,400
By 2018,

396
00:26:39,110 --> 00:26:40,920
the King of Votes, James,

397
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:43,550
with a whopping 8.27 million votes,

398
00:26:43,550 --> 00:26:44,640
topped the list.

399
00:26:45,070 --> 00:26:47,350
-That seems not right.
-That seems not right.

400
00:26:47,350 --> 00:26:49,350
I don't think that was the number.

401
00:26:49,350 --> 00:26:49,960
Right.

402
00:26:51,310 --> 00:26:52,160
What's wrong?

403
00:26:53,110 --> 00:26:54,510
It's 6.27 million,

404
00:26:54,510 --> 00:26:56,000
not 8.27 million.

405
00:26:57,550 --> 00:27:00,440
And the one who got the second place
in history at that same year

406
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:02,270
was also LeBron James,

407
00:27:03,000 --> 00:27:05,000
with a whopping 6.62 million votes.

408
00:27:06,310 --> 00:27:08,480
This can be considered a legend.

409
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:10,750
Ms. Zhou Xiangxiang,

410
00:27:11,070 --> 00:27:12,350
I want to confirm again

411
00:27:12,350 --> 00:27:14,440
what James's highest vote count is

412
00:27:14,510 --> 00:27:15,480
in history.

413
00:27:17,110 --> 00:27:18,350
8.27 million.

414
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:27,480
I'll give you one more chance.

415
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:29,240
Are you sure it's 6.27 million?

416
00:27:31,550 --> 00:27:33,510
8.27 million.

417
00:27:33,590 --> 00:27:34,830
Are you sure?

418
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:40,640
Six.

419
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:47,590
She even remembers the vote count wrongly.

420
00:27:47,590 --> 00:27:49,520
How could she remember it wrongly?

421
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:54,330
She even remembers the vote count wrongly.

422
00:27:54,330 --> 00:27:55,290
[The Starry Sky]

423
00:27:54,440 --> 00:27:55,590
Right. I don't know.

424
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:56,920
She doesn't understand at all.

425
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:57,980
Can you do it or not?

426
00:27:59,370 --> 00:28:00,270
-What's wrong?
-What happened?

427
00:28:00,270 --> 00:28:00,750
What's going on?

428
00:28:00,750 --> 00:28:01,550
What's wrong?

429
00:28:01,590 --> 00:28:02,400
-What's going on?
-What's happening?

430
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:03,310
What's happening?

431
00:28:03,310 --> 00:28:04,440
Director, I'll go take a look.

432
00:28:04,440 --> 00:28:05,270
Okay. Go now.

433
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,160
I'm sorry.

434
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,750
Sir, I'm sorry.

435
00:28:07,770 --> 00:28:09,500
You might have to wait a moment.

436
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:12,960
Xiangxiang!

437
00:28:12,960 --> 00:28:14,000
Did she go down?

438
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:14,730
Where is she?

439
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:21,440
It's 6,275,459

440
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,310
votes in total.

441
00:28:24,590 --> 00:28:26,680
How could I be so wrong?

442
00:28:28,790 --> 00:28:30,000
Stop thinking about it.

443
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:31,400
The judges haven't announced

444
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:32,640
