445
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,440
Exactly.

446
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,960
Just get a good night's sleep.

447
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:37,480
When you wake up tomorrow,
everything will be fine.

448
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:39,010
You guys don't understand.

449
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:42,240
This kind of mistake
can count as a broadcasting accident.

450
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:44,000
If this had really happened
during the filming of a show,

451
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:45,000
I would be doomed.

452
00:28:46,240 --> 00:28:48,480
If it were because I hadn't prepared well,

453
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,680
I would just let it go.

454
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,680
I just feel like I've let you guys down,

455
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:54,280
as well as Li Sirui and the others
who helped me.

456
00:28:54,750 --> 00:28:56,590
You're treating us like strangers
by saying that.

457
00:28:56,590 --> 00:28:58,320
It's what we're supposed to do.

458
00:28:58,550 --> 00:29:00,400
This time, it was mainly for practice.

459
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:01,680
There will be many more opportunities
in the future.

460
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,810
Don't overthink it.

461
00:29:03,110 --> 00:29:03,480
Right.

462
00:29:03,480 --> 00:29:05,240
Xiangxiang, I have to say

463
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:08,170
