while hosting on stage.

464
00:29:10,880 --> 00:29:11,550
Never mind.

465
00:29:12,350 --> 00:29:14,310
Actually, I was quite lucky

466
00:29:14,400 --> 00:29:15,930
as there was a power outage.

467
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:18,880
Otherwise, I would be embarrassed
in front of everyone.

468
00:29:18,880 --> 00:29:19,960
It's fine now.

469
00:29:24,230 --> 00:29:26,310
[Monitoring Room of Jiangcheng University]

470
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:26,720
I've checked. Someone did it on purpose.

471
00:29:26,330 --> 00:29:28,250
[Jiangcheng University]

472
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:29,100
Someone did it on purpose?

473
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:31,350
The staff went to
check the electrical box.

474
00:29:31,350 --> 00:29:32,410
It was forced open.

475
00:29:32,880 --> 00:29:34,880
They came to our school
for recruitment interviews.

476
00:29:34,880 --> 00:29:35,960
Such an incident

477
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:37,760
would lead to negative effects.

478
00:29:38,480 --> 00:29:39,070
Sir.

479
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:40,070
The director

480
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:41,880
has already gone to explain it
to the platform staff.

481
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:44,480
I also need to explain it
to the school leaders.

482
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,980
Hurry up and figure out the truth.

483
00:29:45,980 --> 00:29:47,880
[Internet Security Management]

484
00:29:46,440 --> 00:29:47,440
Don't worry, sir.

485
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,480
Gosh.

486
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:49,450
[Campus Anti-Fraud]

487
00:29:49,790 --> 00:29:50,270
Let's continue.

488
00:29:50,270 --> 00:29:50,880
Okay.

489
00:29:53,050 --> 00:29:58,470
[June 28, 2019]

490
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:55,160
Let's take a look at this.

491
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:55,760
Thank you.

492
00:30:00,110 --> 00:30:02,060
This way, how can we figure out who it is?

493
00:30:02,060 --> 00:30:05,490
[June 28, 2019]

494
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,840
Please zoom in a bit more.

495
00:30:04,590 --> 00:30:05,200
Thank you.

496
00:30:11,510 --> 00:30:12,110
Here.

497
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:13,070
Turn this on.

498
00:30:16,300 --> 00:30:19,710
[Teacher's Office]

499
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:23,400
Gu Han,

500
00:30:23,960 --> 00:30:24,590
