501
00:30:24,590 --> 00:30:25,850
-Was it you?
-It was me.

502
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:29,590
-Why did you pull the switch?
-No reason.

503
00:30:29,590 --> 00:30:30,200
I...

504
00:30:30,750 --> 00:30:32,480
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

505
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:33,070
You...

506
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:37,590
Very well, Gu Han.

507
00:30:38,110 --> 00:30:40,270
Don't think the school basketball team
can't do without you,

508
00:30:40,270 --> 00:30:42,680
and that you can just
disrupt the school activities.

509
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:44,510
In particular,
we collaborated with a website

510
00:30:44,510 --> 00:30:46,240
on this campus TV station exam.

511
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:48,330
It has led to a very serious impact,

512
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:50,240
so you must be severely punished!

513
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,960
Sir, please calm down.

514
00:30:52,510 --> 00:30:53,960
We have already talked to

515
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,200
the Starry Sky's staff.

516
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:55,790
Yes.

517
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:57,240
We have already apologized

518
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,030
