519
00:30:58,110 --> 00:31:00,710
that Gu Han didn't touch the switch
on purpose.

520
00:31:00,830 --> 00:31:02,090
What did they suggest?

521
00:31:02,240 --> 00:31:04,830
They suggested
dealing with Gu Han leniently.

522
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:06,720
They don't want to make things too tense.

523
00:31:06,720 --> 00:31:08,960
Besides, it was only interrupted
for a short while,

524
00:31:08,960 --> 00:31:10,480
so the impact was not very big.

525
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:12,440
Although they've accepted our apology,

526
00:31:12,440 --> 00:31:14,270
