527
00:31:14,270 --> 00:31:15,400
You must be punished.

528
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:17,330
No! You must be punished severely!

529
00:31:19,810 --> 00:31:27,090
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

530
00:31:26,550 --> 00:31:27,200
Fang Yu.

531
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:32,830
That day, I did it...

532
00:31:34,270 --> 00:31:36,470
-Because I wanted to...
-I understand.

533
00:31:36,550 --> 00:31:38,010
You did it for Xiangxiang.

534
00:31:40,270 --> 00:31:41,480
But you were taking a risk by doing that.

535
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:42,540
Do you understand?

536
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,000
It's fine.

537
00:31:45,590 --> 00:31:47,320
This punishment isn't severe.

538
00:31:50,590 --> 00:31:51,590
Anyway,

539
00:31:52,750 --> 00:31:53,960
