540
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:54,690
Understand?

541
00:32:02,790 --> 00:32:05,050
I'll go clean it up again this afternoon.

542
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:15,070
Oh, no.

543
00:32:15,440 --> 00:32:16,640
Something serious happened.

544
00:32:16,640 --> 00:32:17,480
What's wrong?

545
00:32:18,110 --> 00:32:20,750
Wasn't there a power outage suddenly
during the streamer audition yesterday?

546
00:32:20,750 --> 00:32:23,070
The school found out
it wasn't an accident.

547
00:32:23,070 --> 00:32:24,600
Someone pulled the switch.

548
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:25,640
Who was it?

549
00:32:26,350 --> 00:32:27,200
It was...

550
00:32:28,590 --> 00:32:29,590
Captain Gu.

551
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:34,310
To prevent Xiangxiang
from making a fool of herself,

552
00:32:34,310 --> 00:32:35,590
