553
00:32:35,590 --> 00:32:37,320
and bravely pulled the switch.

554
00:32:37,920 --> 00:32:39,550
Now he's going to be severely
punished by the school.

555
00:32:39,550 --> 00:32:41,410
How will he be severely punished?

556
00:32:42,110 --> 00:32:43,720
The consequences are very serious.

557
00:32:43,720 --> 00:32:46,720
The teacher from the campus TV station
asked him to...

558
00:32:47,790 --> 00:32:49,030
Just say it!

559
00:32:50,830 --> 00:32:51,550
Write a self-criticism report

560
00:32:51,550 --> 00:32:53,070
and sweep the entire studio
again this afternoon.

561
00:32:53,070 --> 00:32:53,920
That's not too bad.

562
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:54,790
Li Sirui!

563
00:32:56,590 --> 00:32:57,420
No matter how he is punished,

564
00:32:57,420 --> 00:32:58,640
he still took a risk.

565
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:03,450
That's true.

566
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:05,500
He did something decent at least.

567
00:33:07,070 --> 00:33:08,310
I want to have some corn.

568
00:33:08,310 --> 00:33:09,590
Can you stop making a fuss next time?

569
00:33:09,590 --> 00:33:10,200
Alright.

570
00:33:37,270 --> 00:33:38,600
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

571
00:33:47,790 --> 00:33:50,030
The studio has been cleaned up.

572
00:33:50,310 --> 00:33:51,840
This is the only place left.

573
00:34:41,360 --> 00:34:42,840
Can I ask you a question?

574
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:47,110
Whenever I'm with you these past few days,

575
00:34:47,110 --> 00:34:48,400
you seem a bit weird.

576
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:50,170
Did I do something to upset you?

577
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:51,550
No.

578
00:34:51,960 --> 00:34:53,620
You must have misunderstood.

579
00:35:02,630 --> 00:35:03,430
Oh, by the way,

580
00:35:03,920 --> 00:35:04,920
in this exam,

581
00:35:05,110 --> 00:35:07,510
how could you
say the wrong number of votes?

582
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:12,740
I guess when I was memorizing the script,

583
00:35:13,320 --> 00:35:15,850
I was too careless
and remembered it wrongly.

584
00:35:25,110 --> 00:35:25,710
It's okay.

585
00:35:26,110 --> 00:35:27,840
As long as you remember this mistake,

586
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:29,570
you can just improve next time.

587
00:35:35,710 --> 00:35:36,920
I remember before I went on stage,

588
00:35:36,920 --> 00:35:38,580
I kept memorizing the script.

589
00:35:38,840 --> 00:35:39,760
I remember that number

590
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:42,160
seemed to be what was written
on the script.

591
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:45,400
But that seems unlikely, too.

592
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:47,730
The script they gave me was professional,

593
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:50,020
so I must have remembered it wrongly.

594
00:35:52,110 --> 00:35:53,870
Forget it. I'll stop thinking about it.

595
00:35:53,870 --> 00:35:55,910
There's definitely no hope
this time anyway.
